[6987]="7006A1D5\n1\tDerrota a Krizhmûl\tDefeat the great beast guarding the entrance to the caves of the Isle of Storms.\n2\tDerrota a Urâbaz el Poderoso\tSomeone - or more likely something - has slain most the pirates who once frequented these caves and driven away any survivors. If you want to reach the Roc's aerie above, you're going to have to make your way past it....\n3\tDerrota a Raghârik\tThe tunnels here howl with winds that blow down from the peak, making your progress treacherous - but it seems to be the only path leading to the Roc's aerie above.\n",
[6988]="7006A1D6\n1\tDerrota a Krizhmûl\tDefeat the great beast guarding the entrance to the caves of the Isle of Storms.\n2\tDerrota a Urâbaz el Poderoso\tSomeone - or more likely something - has slain most the pirates who once frequented these caves and driven away any survivors. If you want to reach the Roc's aerie above, you're going to have to make your way past it....\n3\tDerrota a Raghârik\tThe tunnels here howl with winds that blow down from the peak, making your progress treacherous - but it seems to be the only path leading to the Roc's aerie above.\n",
[6989]="700356A8\n1\tHabla con Ránmald\tDeberías hablar con Ránmald.\n2\tPregúntale a Céolflad por qué es tan fría con Ránmald\tDeberías hablar con Céolflad.\n3\tPregúntale a Edhild por qué a las mujeres no les agrada Ránmald\tDeberías hablar con Edhild.\n4\tPregúntale a Frithwyn por qué no le agrada Ránmald\tDeberías hablar con Frithwyn.\n5\tRuge /rugir a las mujeres poco amables\tDeberías expresar tu frustración y rugir a las mujeres. NOTA: Este objetivo requiere un gesto. /rugir\n6\tPregúntale a Ránmald si te disculpa mientras hablas con las otras\tDeberías hablar con Ránmald.\n7\tReúnete con las mujeres de Byre Tor en la tumba de Aldstan\tSe puede encontrar a las mujeres de Byre Tor en la tumba de Aldstan. Deberías hablar con ellas.\n8\tHabla con Edhild\tDeberías hablar con Edhild en la tumba de Aldstan.\n9\tEscucha el discurso de Céolflad\tEscucha el discurso de Céolflad.\n10\tHabla con Céolflad\tHabla con Céolflad.\n11\tHabla con Frithwyn en la tumba de Céolstan\tHabla con Frithwyn en la tumba de Céolstan.\n12\tEscucha a Frithwyn\tEscucha a Frithwyn.\n13\tHabla con Edhild en la tumba de Céolstan\tHabla con Edhild en la tumba de Céolstan.\n14\tVe si Edhild necesita consuelo\tHabla con Edhild otra vez.\n",
[6990]="700000C8\n1\tSal de tu celda y acércate a tu rescatador (Usa W para avanzar)\tDespiertas en un calabozo de un campamento de bandidos. Un hombre de aspecto sombrío -- un Montaraz, Trancos -- está delante de ti. Mientras te pones de pie con dificultad, su voz urgente llega a tus oídos.\n2\tBusca armas en la mochila (Haz clic derecho en la mochila para abrirla)\tUn bolso está en el suelo, cerca de tu rescatador. Trancos te ha dicho que busques armas en el bolso y recojas su contenido, porque necesitarás defenderte durante esta atrevida fuga.\n3\tHabla con Trancos (Haz clic derecho en Trancos para hablar)\tTrancos ha vencido a los guardias bandidos, pero te advierte de que hay más enemigos por delante. El Montaraz quiere que practiques el combate luchando con él para asegurarse de que eres capaz de defenderte durante la fuga.\n4\tHabla con Trancos\tAhora que has practicado el combate, habla con Trancos para saber qué hacer a continuación.\n5\tSigue a Trancos al exterior\tTrancos ha salido de la prisión y ha entrado en el patio. Te está esperando allí.\n6\tHabla con Trancos\tAhora que has salido de la prisión, habla con Trancos para saber cuál es el siguiente paso.\n7\tDerrota a los captores de Celandine (total: 4)\tCelandine Brandigamo está retenida en el campamento de bandidos. Trancos quiere que rescates a los hobbits, empezando por Celandine, mientras él va en busca de señales de Mordor (que se encuentra sorprendentemente cerca). Tendrás que derrotar a todos los bandidos que encuentres mientras buscas a los hobbits.\n8\tHabla con Celandine Brandybuck\tCelandine está retenida en una jaula, junto a la pared del recinto. Has vencido a los captores de Celandine, pero no has encontrado a Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón. Celandine puede que sepa dónde está retenido Mundo.\n9\tDerrota al captor de Mundo\tMundo Sacovilla-Bolsón está retenido en la zona de la prisión, más allá de la puerta de la jaula donde estaba Celandine. La distracción de Celandine fue un éxito. Solo queda un bandido para vigilar a Mundo. Deberías deshacerte de él rápidamente.\n10\tHabla con Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón\tMundo está atado a un poste en el patio. A pesar de la derrota de su captor, Mundo Sacovilla-Bolsón parece estar especialmente disgustado. Deberías animarle a que se una a ti.\n11\tEncuentra a Trancos y Amdir\tTrancos y Amdir os esperan a ti y a los hobbits en la puerta principal. Has liberado a ambos hobbits que habían desaparecido, pero aún no has escapado del campamento.\n12\tHabla con Amdir\tAmdir se encuentra justo más allá de la puerta principal. El Montaraz Amdir fue derribado por el Jinete Negro antes de que Trancos pudiera ahuyentarlo. Deberías preguntarle a Trancos qué hacer, porque la situación es ahora muy grave.\n13\tHabla con Trancos\tTrancos espera cerca a la puerta principal. Amdir está gravemente herido. Trancos sabrá mejor qué hacer para ayudar a su amigo.\n14\tHabla con Trancos\tTrancos espera cerca a la puerta principal. Amdir está gravemente herido. Trancos sabrá mejor qué hacer para ayudar a su amigo.\n",
[6991]="7004729D\n1\tHabla con Malthengil\tMalthengil le ha pedido que entregue su informe sobre Mordor al rey Elessar, pero primero hay algunos asuntos sobre los que el rey debe pronunciarse.\n2\tEspere hasta que el rey le pida su informe\tEl rey Elessar debe evaluar los problemas que enfrenta Gondor y pronunciarse al respecto.\n3\tEncuentra a Beregond en el Salón del Rey y dile que es su momento de juicio\tBeregond está en el salón y no ha escuchado que es su momento de juicio.\n4\tEspere hasta que el rey le pida su informe\tEl rey Elessar debe evaluar los problemas que enfrenta Gondor y pronunciarse al respecto.\n",
[6992]="700544A5\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tTalk to Dolenthol.\n2\tKeep close to Dolenthol and remain alert\tKeep close to Dolenthol and remain alert. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tDefeat Thargaun\030Defeat the Morroval\tDefeat Thargaun and the Morroval. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[6993]="700649B7\n1\tTalk to the Castamir supporter inside the abandoned home\tA supporter of Castamir stands inside an abandoned home and bars your passage.\n2\tFind Maethon somewhere within the abandoned homes of Linhir\tMaethon is somewhere within the abandoned homes taken over by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.\n3\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is within one of the abandoned homes of Linhir now used by supporters of the Heirs of Castamir.\n4\tMaethon asked you to introduce yourself to some of the supporters of Castamir in the cellar of the abandoned home.\t\n5\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n6\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n7\tTalk to Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water, emissary from Umbar, is interested to speak with you.\n8\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters and the emissaries from Umbar\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n9\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n10\tObserve the meeting of the Castamir supporters and the emissaries from Umbar\tSupporters of the Heirs of Castamir secretly meet in a cellar in Linhir.\n11\tTalk to Maethon\tMaethon is in the cellar of an abandoned home in Linhir.\n12\tFollow Maethon upstairs and learn what has happened\tSomething has happened upstairs!\n13\tExamine Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water has been grievously wounded, a deadly blade buried in his back.\n14\tHear what transpired\tTumúldo Fierce-water lies dying, attacked by the supporters of Castamir.\n15\tTalk to Nakási\tNakási Wave-reaper desires vengeance upon the Heirs of Castamir, and has challenged you to stand with her against them.\n16\tHear the final words of Tumúldo Fierce-water\tTumúldo Fierce-water is on the very precipice of death.\n",
[6994]="70038209\n1\tHabla con Éowyn\tÉowyn se encuentra en Meduseld mientras preside Edoras en ausencia del rey Théoden. Debes hablar con Éowyn.\n2\tEscucha a Éowyn\tÉowyn se encuentra en Meduseld mientras preside Edoras en ausencia del rey Théoden. Debes escuchar a Éowyn.\n3\tEscucha a Éowyn\tÉowyn se encuentra en Meduseld mientras preside Edoras en ausencia del rey Théoden. Debes escuchar a Éowyn.\n4\tHabla con Éowyn\tÉowyn se encuentra en Meduseld mientras preside Edoras en ausencia del rey Théoden. Debes hablar con Éowyn.\n5\tHabla con Witwyn, la sirvienta\tWitwyn, la sirvienta de Éowyn, se encuentra en Meduseld. Witwyn desea hablar contigo.\n",
[6995]="7000D5B9\n1\tEncuentra a Laerdan\tEntra en Sammath Baul y encuentra a Laerdan.\n",
[6996]="70067CB8\n1\tTalk to Cruel Dancer in the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has come with you to the hidden harbour.\n2\tBoard the nearest ship to the west in the hidden harbour\tThe nearest of the ships you should investigate is to the west.\n3\tWait for Cruel Dancer to join you aboard the ship\tYou have boarded the first ship and should wait for Cruel Dancer to join you.\n4\tTalk to Cruel Dancer aboard the ship\tCruel Dancer stands aboard the deck of one of the ships moored within the hidden harbour.\n5\tDefeat the Corsair defenders aboard the ship while Cruel Dancer searches below deck\tCorsairs loyal to the Kindred of the Coins have learned of your presence in the hidden harbour!\n6\tTalk to Cruel Dancer aboard the first ship in the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has returned from her search of the first ship's interior.\n7\tFollow the walkways to the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tHaving found no one within the first ship, Cruel Dancer believes the hostages you seek may be aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.\n8\tTalk to Corudan aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tCorudan is a captive aboard the second ship, but he is still alive.\n9\tWait for the ship's captain to arrive\tWait for the captain of the ship to arrive.\n10\tTalk to Tatháta the Beast aboard her ship\tTatháta the Beast stands upon the deck of her ship.\n11\tWitness the confrontation between Cruel Dancer and Tatháta the Beast\tCruel Dancer engages Tatháta the Beast in conversation aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour.\n12\tDefeat Tatháta and her crew\tThe conversation has become a violent conflict!\n13\tTalk to Corudan aboard the second ship moored within the hidden harbour\tCruel Dancer has chased after Tatháta the Beast, but your priority must be to rescue Corudan.\n",
[6997]="70064F75\n1\tTalk to Caebar in Lond Cirion\tCaebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, where Golasgil's testament will be read.\n2\tListen to the reading of Golasgil's final wishes\tKing Elessar has commanded that Lord Golasgil's testament be read aloud and his wishes carried out.\n3\tExamine the papers that contain Golasgil's final wishes\tLady Marra has produced her husband's final wishes and set them on the table.\n4\tStand ready in the event you will be of some use\tKing Elessar has suggested that his scribe Caebar may be able to ascertain the provenance of the handwriting contained in Golasgil's purported testament.\n5\tThe study of Lond Cirion may contain samples of Lord Golasgil's writing that can be used to prove he wrote the testament, and its provenance made secure.\t\n6\tGive Golasgil's notes on the currents to Caebar\tCaebar is in the study of Lond Cirion, seeking to prove that Golasgil's testament was truly written by the Lord of Anfalas before his death in battle.\n7\tListen to the reading of Golasgil's final wishes\tYou and Caebar have proven that both the testament and Golasgil's notes on the currents were written by the same person, and now the Lord of Anfalas's last wishes can be read aloud and carried out.\n8\tHabla con el rey Elessar\tKing Elessar is in the study of Lond Cirion.\n",
[6998]="7003E68E\n1\tHabla con Glorfindel\tDebes hablar con Glorfindel antes de enfrentarte al enemigo. Glorfindel está afuera de Ost Brandras y espera tu ayuda para confrontar a Ferndúr el Virulento.\n2\tSigue a Glorfindel dentro de Ost Brandras\tGlorfindel está en Ost Brandras. Debes seguir a Glorfindel dentro de las ruinas y enfrentar a Ferndúr el Virulento.\n3\tÁbrete paso hasta el altar junto a Glorfindel\tGlorfindel está en Ost Brandras. Debes seguir a Glorfindel dentro de las ruinas y enfrentar a Ferndúr el Virulento.\n4\tHabla con Glorfindel\tGlorfindel está al pie del altar en Ost Brandras. Te has abierto paso entre numerosos espíritus malignos y ahora debes enfrentar a Ferndúr cuando estés preparado.\n5\tAcércate a los hombres demacrados en lo alto del altar\tLos hombres demacrados se encuentran en la cima del altar en Ost Brandras. Has llegado a la base del altar y ahora debes enfrentarte a los hombres demacrados.\n6\tDerrota a Ferndúr el Virulento y a sus hombres demacrados\tFerndúr el Virulento se encuentra en la cima del altar en Ost Brandras. Ya te has enfrentado a Ferndúr y ahora debes derrotarlo.\n",
[6999]="70015E43\n1\tEncuentra al líder de los trolls silvanos\tDesciende al escondite de los trolls silvanos y derrota a su líder.\n2\tDerrota a Zagâfum\030Derrota a Logon\tDerrota a Zagâfum y Logon.\n",
[7000]="70041A47\n1\tSearch for Nimithil among the crowd\tNimithil can be found somewhere in the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have travelled to the hall with Nimithil, but became separated amid a large crowd of belligerent people. You should reunite with Nimithil.\n2\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have found Nimithil, but the Steward has not yet returned to the Hall. You should ask Nimithil what is to be done.\n3\tListen to Nimithil speak to the crowd of Gondorians\tNimithil is standing in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Nimithil is concerned that the arguing in the hall will soon turn to violence and asks for your support in calming the crowd.\n4\tObserve the meeting between Nimithil and Malthellim\tNimithil and Malthellim are speaking near the fire-pit in the centre of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Nimithil is sharing what you have learned in Lornost and Ost Anglebed with Malthellim. You should listen as they speak.\n5\tDefeat Yamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ\tYamanim, Hosdam, and Khutâ are moving against the dissenters within the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Malthellim has aligned himself with the Heirs of Castamir and has now allowed the Corsair and Haradrim men in Ost Anglebed to execute dissenting folk.\n6\tSubdue Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Hall of Ost Anglebed. Malthellim has drawn his weapon in desperation, and must now be subdued if the people of Ost Anglebed are to remain safe.\n7\tTalk to Nimithil\tNimithil can be found in the rear of the Hall of Ost Anglebed. You have subdued Steward Malthellim with the aid of Nimithil's guards, and should now speak to Nimithil.\n",
[7001]="7003ADB8\n1\tAsk the boss when the battle will be done\tThe Uruk-commander stands near the ugly gate up ahead. You should ask the boss when the battle will be over, for you grow bored without a drop of blood to stain your sword.\n2\tGet back in line and talk to your neighbour\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should get back in line.\n3\tWatch and wait\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should watch and wait.\n4\tTalk to your neighbour again\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should speak with your neighbour.\n5\tWatch and wait\tYour place in line is back a ways, near some other Orcs. You should watch and wait.\n6\tTry to escape south\tYou must try to escape! Run south, towards Helm's Deep.\n7\tTry to escape towards the north-west\tYou must try to escape! Run north-west, towards the Fords of Isen.\n8\tTry to escape towards the east\tYou must try to escape! Run east, along the dike.\n9\tRun north!\tYou must try to escape! Run north...into the strange trees.\n10\tFind a spot to rest, and rest briefly at the edge of the trees\tFind a resting spot at the edge of the trees.\n11\tEscape through the forest!\tTry to survive!\n",
[7002]="700253DB\n1\tBusca en Lhaid Ogo al mensajero dunlendino perdido\tLas profundidades fangosas de Lhaid Ogo albergan muchos horrores en descomposición, y un mensajero dunlendino puede estar perdido en su interior.\n2\tHabla con Anirin en Lhaid Ogo\tHas encontrado a Anirin en las profundidades de Lhaid Ogo y deberías hablar con él.\n",
[7003]="7003971A\n1\tSpeak with Calin\tSpeak to Calin before joining the confrontation. It appears Gifemund and Thurferth are in an argument that could get violent near the empty throne.\n2\tObserva la discusión\tThere is a heated discussion between Gifemund and Thurferth in front of the empty throne in the mead hall.\n3\tObserve Calin and Gifemund's discussion\tNow that Thurferth has left, Gifemund and Calin have engaged in a quieter discussion.\n4\tSpeak with Calin\tSpeak to Calin near the throne at the back of the mead hall.\n",
[7004]="7002C00E\n1\tHabla con Céola\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías hablar cuanto antes con Céola para conocer su plan.\n2\tDerrota a todos los asaltantes Khundolar\t\n3\tHabla con Céola en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías hablar con Céola sobre la batalla de Etheburg.\n",
[7005]="70056FAE\n1\tTalk to Venko at Limlók\tVenko is ready to speak with the Beorning chieftain at the village of Limlók and learn if he has seen the missing raiding-party from Gundabad.\n2\tMeet with Runerik, the village chieftain of Limlók\tVenko wishes to speak with the village chieftain of Limlók to learn what befell the raiding-party from Gundabad.\n3\tExamine the south-eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the north-eastern fence of Limlók\030Examine the north-western fence of Limlók\030Examine the south-western fence of Limlók\tRunerik believes his town has nothing to fear from the missing raiding-party, but your companions want to check Limlók's exterior fences just to make sure.\n4\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard outside his house in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard stands outside his home in Limlók.\n5\tFollow Runerik Knotbeard\tRunerik does not believe his village is any more susceptible to danger than is usual for his people.\n6\tFind Imák and protect him from the Orcs\030Find Venko and protect him from the Orcs\tThe raiding-party has attacked the village of Limlók from multiple directions at the same time!\n7\tReturn to Glóin in the village square and protect him from the Orcs\tThe raiding-party has attacked the village of Limlók from multiple directions at the same time!\n8\tListen to Glóin's words\tThe raiding-party that threatened the safety of Limlók has been defeated, thanks to your efforts and those of your companions, as well as those of the people who dwell there. One Orc remains alive, but he will soon die of his wounds.\n9\tTalk to Natsatúg before he dies of his wounds\tThe raiding-party that threatened the safety of Limlók has been defeated, thanks to your efforts and those of your companions, as well as those of the people who dwell there. One Orc remains alive, but he will soon die of his wounds.\n",
[7006]="7006056D\n1\tHabla con Prestadír a las afueras de Eitheldir\tPrestadír se encuentra a las afueras de las ruinas de Eitheldir.\n2\tHabla con Prestadír\tPrestadír se encuentra en las ruinas de Eitheldir.\n3\tHabla con Prestadír\tPrestadír se encuentra en las ruinas de Eitheldir.\n4\tSigue a Prestadír por el agujero del muro\tPrestadír te ha pedido que lo sigas afuera.\n5\tHabla con Prestadír fuera de los muros de Eitheldir\tPrestadír se encuentra sobre las turbulentas aguas del Fontegrís, justo fuera de los muros de Eitheldir.\n",
[7007]="7004544D\n1\tFind the source of the Dheghûn\030Defeat Dheghûn (total: 10)\tDefeat the Dheghûn and find out where they are coming from within the Nardol mines.\n2\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn.\n3\tDefeat Gúthrakh the Ravenous\tDestroy the source of the Dheghûn.\n4\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tYou should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n",
[7008]="700300F5\n1\tHabla con Baillas\tEl viejo Ent Baillas está en Fangorn.\n2\tBusca al este de Baillas la fuente del sonido\tEl sonido de susurro provenía del este de Baillas.\n3\tHabla con Baillas\tEl viejo Ent Baillas está en Fangorn.\n",
})
